' Ditulis manual. Use case detail Guru.
@startuml uc-guru
!include _gaya.iuml
left to right direction
title Use Case Diagram — Guru

actor "Guru" as Guru

rectangle "Portal Guru" {
  usecase "Login" as Login
  usecase "Melihat dashboard\n(agenda hari ini, kelas)" as Dash
  usecase "Mengisi presensi kelas" as Presensi
  usecase "Menandai hadir semua" as Semua
  usecase "Menginput penilaian\nper domain" as Nilai
  usecase "Melihat rekap penilaian" as Rekap
  usecase "Menyusun laporan\nperkembangan (draf)" as Laporan
  usecase "Mengirim laporan\nuntuk direview" as Kirim
  usecase "Melihat jadwal mengajar" as Jadwal
  usecase "Melihat kegiatan sekolah" as Kegiatan
  usecase "Melihat profil" as Profil
}

Guru --> Login
Guru --> Dash
Guru --> Presensi
Presensi <.. Semua : <<extend>>
Guru --> Nilai
Nilai <.. Rekap : <<extend>>
Guru --> Laporan
Laporan <.. Kirim : <<extend>>
Guru --> Jadwal
Guru --> Kegiatan
Guru --> Profil
Dash ..> Login : <<include>>

note right of Presensi
  Guru hanya dapat mengakses
  kelas yang ia ampu
  (dicek di server).
end note
@enduml
